      "id": "claim_f32e61c15a80468b92599bd20aacd627",
      "statement": "The discretion matrix is the cross-mandate ceiling for discretionary mandates: mandate guides may impose tighter limits but cannot expand discretion, and the applicable mandate band determines the governing limit.",
